## 7️⃣ Generating / Converting a PMTiles file (if you don’t have one)

| Tool | Command (quick) | Output |
|------|----------------|--------|
| **tippecanoe** (v2.17+) | `tippecanoe -zg -o mydata.pmtiles data.geojson` | Direct PMTiles |
| **tippecanoe** → MBTiles → PMTiles | `tippecanoe -o mydata.mbtiles data.geojson && pmtiles convert mydata.mbtiles mydata.pmtiles` | Two‑step |
| **Planetiler** | `java -jar planetiler.jar --area=monaco --output=monaco.pmtiles` | OSM → PMTiles |
| **pmtiles CLI** (convert) | `pmtiles convert input.mbtiles output.pmtiles` | MBTiles → PMTiles |
| **pmtiles CLI** (inspect) | `pmtiles show mydata.pmtiles` | Verify bounds/zoom |

> **Tip:** After you generate the file, run `pmtiles verify mydata.pmtiles` to be sure the archive isn’t corrupted before you upload it.

